bottomparticipants

actor Admin
boundary "Comments Management UI" as UI
boundary Router
control AccessTokenGuard
control RolesGuard
control CommentsController
control CommentsService
entity ":CommentsModel" as CommentsModel
entity ":ChaptersModel" as ChaptersModel
entity ":MangaModel" as MangaModel
entity ":UsersModel" as UsersModel
database MongoDB

Admin -> UI: 1. Open /admin/comments
activate Admin
activate UI

UI -> UI: 2. Init state (comments=[], loading=true)
activate UI
space
deactivate UI

UI -> Router: 3. GET /api/comment/all
activate Router

Router -> AccessTokenGuard: 4. canActivate(request)
activate AccessTokenGuard

opt Token invalid
  AccessTokenGuard --> Router: 4.1. Deny
  Router --> UI: 4.2. 401 Unauthorized
  UI --> Admin: 4.3. Show error message
end

AccessTokenGuard --> Router: 5. Allow
deactivate AccessTokenGuard

Router -> RolesGuard: 6. checkRole(ADMIN)
activate RolesGuard

opt Role invalid
  RolesGuard --> Router: 6.1. Deny
  Router --> UI: 6.2. 403 Forbidden
  UI --> Admin: 6.3. Show error message
end

RolesGuard --> Router: 7. Allow
deactivate RolesGuard

Router -> CommentsController: 8. getAllComments()
activate CommentsController

CommentsController -> CommentsService: 9. getAllComments()
activate CommentsService

CommentsService -> CommentsModel: 10. find() + sort(createdAt desc)
activate CommentsModel
CommentsModel -> MongoDB: 11. query comments
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> CommentsModel: 12. comment documents
deactivate MongoDB
CommentsModel --> CommentsService: 13. comments[]
deactivate CommentsModel

CommentsService -> ChaptersModel: 14. populate chapter_id
activate ChaptersModel
ChaptersModel -> MongoDB: 15. query chapters
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> ChaptersModel: 16. chapter docs
deactivate MongoDB
ChaptersModel --> CommentsService: 17. populated chapters
deactivate ChaptersModel

CommentsService -> MangaModel: 18. populate manga_id
activate MangaModel
MangaModel -> MongoDB: 19. query mangas
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> MangaModel: 20. manga docs
deactivate MongoDB
MangaModel --> CommentsService: 21. populated mangas
deactivate MangaModel

CommentsService -> UsersModel: 22. populate user_id
activate UsersModel
UsersModel -> MongoDB: 23. query users
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> UsersModel: 24. user docs
deactivate MongoDB
UsersModel --> CommentsService: 25. populated users
deactivate UsersModel

CommentsService --> CommentsController: 26. populated comments[]
deactivate CommentsService

CommentsController --> Router: 27. 200 OK + comments[]
deactivate CommentsController

Router --> UI: 28. JSON comments[]
deactivate Router

UI --> Admin: 29. Show comment table

deactivate UI
deactivate Admin

@enduml